+### Project logo
+
+You can upload a custom logo for your project. The logo appears in the project switcher and account menu, making it easier to identify projects at a glance.
+
+To upload a project logo:
+
+1. Go to [**Settings**](https://app.posthog.com/settings/project#display-name) > **Project** > **Customization** > **Project details**
+2. Click **Upload** next to the project name and select an image
+3. Click **Save**
+
+To remove a logo, hover over the current logo, click the remove button, and then click **Save**.
+
+Only project admins and organization admins or owners can upload or remove project logos.
+
+If no logo is uploaded, the first character of the project name is used as the icon. You can use an emoji at the start of your project name (e.g., "🚀 My Project") as the project icon in the menu.
+
